{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-15T21:50:02.937Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"5a9b11909dc67e55679cf55b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Reproduction (pm 2026.11.14)\n\n```console\n$ NODE_TEST_CONTEXT=child pm ops telemetry status --json\n# enabled=false, env_overrides.test_suppressed=true\n$ NODE_TEST_CONTEXT=child PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=automation pm ops telemetry status --json\n# enabled=true, env_overrides.test_suppressed=false\n```\n\n## Root cause\n\n`src/core/telemetry/policy.ts`, `resolveTelemetryEnvironmentPolicy`:\n\n```ts\nconst testSuppressed = inferredTest && !SOURCE_CONTEXTS.has(override) &&\n  !telemetryEnvironmentFlag(\"PM_TELEMETRY_SEND_TEST_EVENTS\", env);\n```\n\nEvery member of `SOURCE_CONTEXTS` (automation, ci, test, ...) counts as an explicit opt-in. Only `test` (or the existing force flag `PM_TELEMETRY_SEND_TEST_EVENTS`) says that test telemetry is intended.\n\n## Impact\n\n- Telemetry and Sentry count package-test fixtures as real automation activity. That is the failure mode the closed inferred-test suppression item fixed, reached by a new route. Expected fixture refusals then look like production errors.\n- Emitting children queue events and may start detached flush workers, which slows suites run under agents.\n\n## Fix direction\n\n- When a test runner is detected, suppress unless the opt-in is explicit: `PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=test` or `PM_TELEMETRY_SEND_TEST_EVENTS`. An inherited `automation`, `ci` or other non-test context no longer re-enables emission.\n- `pm ops telemetry status` reports the deciding input, for example `decided_by: \"env:NODE_TEST_CONTEXT\"` or `\"env:PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT\"`, next to `test_suppressed`.\n- Outside a test runner, `automation` behaves exactly as today."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1735"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1735: an inherited PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=automation re-enables telemetry inside detected test runners, so package test fixtures emit as real automation activity"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Inside a detected test runner (NODE_TEST_CONTEXT, VITEST, NODE_ENV=test, BUN_TEST), any recognized PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT re-enables telemetry. resolveTelemetryEnvironmentPolicy suppresses test telemetry only when the override is not a known source context. So an inherited automation value, which agent harnesses and release scripts export to attribute their real writes, makes every pm child a package test suite spawns emit full telemetry labelled automation. The context that labels who acts also decides whether to emit, and no setting keeps both."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","gh:1735","observability","telemetry"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-15T21:50:02.937Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-15T21:50:02.937Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"With NODE_TEST_CONTEXT set and PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=automation inherited, telemetry stays suppressed (test_suppressed=true); With PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=test or PM_TELEMETRY_SEND_TEST_EVENTS inside a test runner, telemetry emits labelled test; Outside a test runner, an automation source context behaves exactly as before; pm ops telemetry status reports the deciding input next to test_suppressed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-5oj5"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-745epp","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-15T21:50:02.937Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"cef71134a5ec17b5bf8c9bda596b4434f6b2a795e38502a53107feda13a8bd4c","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"00cdf88f29927e985eba400782453e108e534129361525e49ad13db493999a4a"}
